    "name":  "Architectural Aluminum Profile Flush with Plaster / Drywall | for LED Strips | 2 meters",
    "reference":  "91444-PACK10",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eArchitectural flush aluminum profile for LED strips up to 12mm,\u003c/strong\u003e designed for elegant and discreet installation between drywall, plaster, or tiles. Its design allows creating \u003cstrong\u003econtinuous light lines without visible frames\u003c/strong\u003e, providing a minimalist and sophisticated finish.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts die-cut fins ensure firm fixation. Ideal for modern non-glare lighting. \u003cstrong\u003eIncludes 4 end caps.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eArchitectural Aluminum Profile Flush in Plaster/Drywall | For LED Strips | 2 meters\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFlush architectural aluminum profile for plaster or drywall. For LED strips up to 12mm. \u003cstrong\u003e2 meters\u003c/strong\u003e. Creates continuous frameless light lines. Includes 4 end caps.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUses: Architectural lighting, ceilings, walls.\u003c/h3\u003e",
